          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "મટવું (maṭvũ) is probably a tadbhava. CDIAL lists it, glossed \"to be rubbed out\", under Sanskrit mṛṣṭa, \"rubbed, washed\", though it calls one change of sound unexplained (CDIAL 10299); an illness that is cured is rubbed out."
            }
          ]
        },
